'''Super Zeus''' (スーパーゼウス ''Sūpāzeusu'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Super Zeus
|image = E 518.png
|money drop = 3,200¢ - 12,640¢
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
Super Zeus is relatively slow in both attacks and movement, has moderate health and damage, is easily knocked back,and [[Weaken|weakens]] anything he hits to 50%. His range is equal to [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s, so it can be difficult to avoid his attack.

